<div class="wrap page-head"><p class="kicker">CEO and lead wardrobe consultant</p><h1>Halie</h1><p class="lede">Halie's passion for styling backs every aspect of The Urban Sophisticate Collective, which she launched on January 1, 2025.</p></div>
<section class="band" style="padding-top:1.5rem">
  <div class="wrap two-col top">
    <img src="/images/halie-lipstick.jpg" alt="Halie" width="1206" height="1506">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>She blends custom, vintage, and street fashion to craft looks that reflect your style. Her styling began years ago, fueled by a passion for fashion and an appreciation for the unconventional, and her knowledge of brands has made her a reliable authority. Modeling is what first sparked her interest in wardrobing, since she styled her own looks on set.</p>
      <p>She has worked with individuals going through life changes, athletes, and professionals from major industries, and has been collecting vintage and vinyl since 2008.</p>
      <p>She is a Dalmatian gal and loves her pup, Oakley, named after the neighborhood in Cincinnati. She is a true foodie with a penchant for niche restaurants; ask her about styling and she may also point you to the best dinner in town.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:2rem"><a class="btn" href="/contact/">Work with Halie</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
